        "description": "<p>Trigger: The target does not have @Affliction[grapple].</p><p>Effect: On hit, the user and target gain @Affliction[grapple], and the user is made Dominant in the Grapple. This Action's Accuracy is inherently modified by the user's and target's Lift Skills, both creatures' Height and Weight Classes, and a Skill based on the each creature’s current Movement State:</p><p>Overland: Acrobatics<br>Swim: Swim<br>Burrow: Climb<br>Flight: Acrobatics<br>Teleport: The better of Psychic and Parapsychology<br>Threaded: The better of Handiwork and Sleight of Hand</p>",
